abstract: >-
  Analysis workflow for development, temporal validation, and multicenter external
  validation of an early prediction model for persistent invasive mechanical
  ventilation or death by 72 hours in critically ill patients with status epilepticus
  using MIMIC-IV and eICU-CRD.
